# Cloudflare Pages headers file.
#
# Purpose: keep the DEV preview site (dev.moonshot.bendentremont.com, served
# by Cloudflare Pages from the `dev` branch) out of search engines, so it
# can never outrank or duplicate the real production site
# (moonshot.bendentremont.com, served by GitHub Pages from `main`).
#
# X-Robots-Tag: noindex is the strongest de-index signal — Google honors it fully.
#
# MERGE-SAFE: this file only affects Cloudflare Pages. GitHub Pages (which
# serves production from `main`) does not process `_headers` at all, so even
# when `dev` merges into `main`, production indexing is unaffected.

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
